<title>DENMARK: Carlsberg ups stake in Sweden's Falcon.</title>
<headline>Carlsberg ups stake in Sweden's Falcon.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish brewer Carlsberg on Monday said it had raised its holding in Sweden's Falcon-Bryggerier AB to 50 percent from its previous 30 percent stake.</p>
<p>A Carlsberg statement said that the purchase followed former partner Spira AB's decision to sell its 40 percent share of the Swedish brewery.</p>
<p>Carlsberg and Finnish shareholder Oy Sinebrychoff, which also previously owned 30 percent of Falcon, were each taking 20 percent from Spira, becoming joint owners, the statement added. --Ole Mikkelsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969654</p>
</text>
